{"_comment": "dev_docs 断言账本。每行一条可机器复验的断言。字段：id 唯一标识；claim 断言原文；kind count|default|architecture|path|process；expected 期望值（字符串比较）；verify 可复现命令（cwd=仓库根，取 stdout 首行）；pattern 可选，用于在文档正文中扫描该数值以做跨文档对账，须恰含一个数字捕获组；evidence_level E1-E4；sources 证据文件；note 口径说明；round 首次登记轮次。由 cross_doc_consistency_checker.py --ledger 消费。", "id": "_schema"}
{"id": "workspace_crates", "claim": "Cargo workspace 含 134 个 crate", "kind": "count", "expected": "134", "verify": "cargo metadata --no-deps --format-version 1 --manifest-path codex-rs/Cargo.toml 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \"import json,sys;print(len(json.load(sys.stdin)['packages']))\"", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/Cargo.toml"], "note": "cargo metadata 口径，含仅以 path 依赖参与与 tests/common 辅助 crate；与 [workspace] members 显式列出的 128 项差 6", "round": 5}
{"id": "workspace_members_listed", "claim": "[workspace] members 显式列出 128 项", "kind": "count", "expected": "128", "verify": "python3 -c \"import re;t=open('codex-rs/Cargo.toml').read();m=re.search(r'members\\s*=\\s*\\[(.*?)\\]',t,re.S);print(len(re.findall(r'\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"',m.group(1))))\"", "evidence_level": "E2", "sources": ["codex-rs/Cargo.toml"], "note": "与 workspace_crates 的 134 差 6，差额需在 crate_map 中说明", "round": 5}
{"id": "utils_crates", "claim": "codex-rs/utils/ 下 23 个工具 crate", "kind": "count", "expected": "23", "verify": "git ls-files 'codex-rs/utils/*/Cargo.toml' | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "(\\d{1,3})\\s*个(?:通用)?工具\\s*crate", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/utils"], "note": "首版曾在标题写 20 而表格列 23，是 checker 盲区 X1 的来源", "round": 5}
{"id": "ext_crates", "claim": "codex-rs/ext/ 下 12 个 crate", "kind": "count", "expected": "12", "verify": "git ls-files 'codex-rs/ext/*/Cargo.toml' | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "(\\d{1,3})\\s*个\\s*`?ext/\\*`?\\s*crate", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/ext"], "round": 5}
{"id": "ext_with_extension_api", "claim": "12 个 ext/* crate 中 8 个在 [dependencies] 中依赖 codex-extension-api", "kind": "count", "expected": "8", "verify": "n=0; for f in codex-rs/ext/*/Cargo.toml; do awk '/^\\[dependencies\\]/{d=1;next}/^\\[/{d=0}d' \"$f\" | grep -q '^codex-extension-api' && n=$((n+1)); done; echo $n", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/ext"], "note": "必须限定 [dependencies] 段；首版用 grep -rl 数文件名得出 12/12，是 HIGH 错误 H3 的来源", "round": 5}
{"id": "ci_workflows", "claim": ".github/workflows 下 27 个 yml", "kind": "count", "expected": "27", "verify": "ls .github/workflows/*.yml 2>/dev/null | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "CI\\s*工作流(?:数)?[（(]?(\\d{1,3})\\s*个", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": [".github/workflows"], "round": 5}
{"id": "insta_snapshots", "claim": "全仓 681 个 .snap 快照文件", "kind": "count", "expected": "681", "verify": "git ls-files '*.snap' | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "(\\d{3,5})\\s*个(?:\\s*insta)?\\s*快照", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": [], "round": 5}
{"id": "tests_rs_files", "claim": "全仓 457 个 *_tests.rs 文件", "kind": "count", "expected": "457", "verify": "git ls-files '*_tests.rs' | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "(\\d{2,5})\\s*个\\s*`?\\*_tests\\.rs`?", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": [], "round": 5}
{"id": "config_schema_keys", "claim": "config.schema.json 有 93 个顶层键", "kind": "count", "expected": "93", "verify": "python3 -c \"import json;print(len(json.load(open('codex-rs/core/config.schema.json'))['properties']))\"", "pattern": "(\\d{1,3})\\s*个(?:配置)?顶层键|顶层键[^\\n]{0,6}?(\\d{2,3})\\s*个", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/core/config.schema.json"], "round": 5}
{"id": "ts_v2_schema_files", "claim": "ts-rs 导出 550 个 TypeScript 类型文件", "kind": "count", "expected": "550", "verify": "git ls-files 'codex-rs/app-server-protocol/schema/typescript/v2/*' | wc -l | tr -d ' '", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["codex-rs/app-server-protocol/schema/typescript/v2"], "note": "口径是 v2 目录下的文件数，不含 v1", "round": 5}
{"id": "agents_md_bytes", "claim": "AGENTS.md 为 22,519 字节", "kind": "count", "expected": "22519", "verify": "wc -c < AGENTS.md | tr -d ' '", "pattern": "AGENTS\\.md[^\\n]{0,12}?([\\d,]{4,9})\\s*字节", "evidence_level": "E4", "sources": ["AGENTS.md"], "round": 5}
